level":3,"children":[{"text":"1. Definitionsmenge"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Wenn du die Definitionsmenge einer Bruchgleichung bestimmen willst, musst du dir die Frage stellen, für welche Werte von "},{"type":"math","src":"x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":" eine "},{"type":"math","src":"0","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0"}]},{"text":" im Nenner eines Bruches stehen würde. "}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Du kannst also jeden Bruch, bei dem ein "},{"type":"math","src":" x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":" im Nenner vorkommt, nacheinander anschauen und dich dabei jedesmal fragen, "},{"text":"für welchen Wert von ","strong":true},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbf{x}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x","strong":true}]},{"text":" der "},{"text":"Nenner ","strong":true},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbf{0}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0","strong":true}]},{"text":" sein würde. Diese Werte musst du aus der Definitionsmenge ausschließen."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"h","level":4,"children":[{"text":"Erster Bruch: "},{"type":"math","src":"\frac{1}{x}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\dfrac{1}{x}"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der Nenner dieses Bruches ist "},{"type":"math","src":"x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":". Das heißt, der Nenner wird "},{"type":"math","src":"0","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0"}]},{"text":", wenn "},{"type":"math","src":"x = 0","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x = 0"}]},{"text":" ist."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"h","level":4,"children":[{"text":"Zweiter Bruch: "},{"type":"math","src":"\frac{3}{x + 3}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\dfrac{3}{x + 3}"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der Nenner dieses Bruches ist "},{"type":"math","src":"x + 3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x + 3"}]},{"text":". Der Nenner wird also "},{"type":"math","src":"0","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0"}]},{"text":", wenn "},{"type":"math","src":"x + 3 = 0","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x + 3 = 0"}]},{"text":" ist. Diese Gleichung kannst du nach x auflösen: "}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcll}
