\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der Nenner dieses Bruches wird also "},{"type":"math","src":"0","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0"}]},{"text":", wenn "},{"type":"math","src":"x = -3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x = -3"}]},{"text":" ist."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"h","level":4,"children":[{"text":"Definitionsmenge aufschreiben"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Jetzt hast du alle Brüche behandelt und kannst die Definitionsmenge aufschreiben: "}]},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbb{D} = \mathbb{Q} \setminus \lbrace -3; 0 \rbrace","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"2. Mit dem Hauptnenner multiplizieren"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Jetzt kannst du beginnen, die Gleichung zu lösen. Dazu multiplizierst du die Gleichung mit dem Hauptnenner. Dieser ist: "},{"type":"math","src":"x\cdot (x + 3)","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x\cdot (x + 3)"}]},{"text":". "}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcll}
